tle=2022_Damallsvenskan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Relegation play-offs\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>The 12th-placed team of Damallsvenskan will meet the third-placed team from 2022 Elitettan in a <a href=\"/wiki/Two-legged_tie\" title=\"Two-legged tie\">two-legged tie</a> on a home-and-away basis with the team from Damallsvenskan finishing at home.\n</p>\n<div class=\"vevent\"><span class=\"summary\" style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/wiki/IK_Uppsala_Fotboll\" title=\"IK Uppsala Fotboll\">Uppsala</a> v <a href=\"/wiki/IF_Brommapojkarna_(women)\" title=\"IF Brommapojkarna (women)\">Brommapojkarna</a></span>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed vevent tmpl-football-box-collapsible tmpl-football-box-collapsible-transparent\" style=\"border-top:1px solid #999;border-bottom:1px solid #999;margin-bottom:-1px;width:100%;background:transparent;color:#202122\"><tbody><tr style=\"vertical-align:top\"><td style=\"width:19%\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;float:right;margin-left:0.5em\">20 November 2022</span> </td><td class=\"vcard attendee\" style=\"width:23%;text-align:right\"><span class=\"fn org\"><b> <a href=\"/wiki/IK_Uppsala_Fotboll\" title=\"IK Uppsala Fotboll\">Uppsala</a> </b></span></td><td style=\"width:12%;text-align:center\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>0–1</b></span></td><td class=\"vcard attendee\" style=\"width:23%\"><span class=\"fn org\"><b> <a href=\"/wiki/IF_Brommapojkarna_(women)\" title=\"IF Brommapojkarna (women)\">Brommapojkarna</a> </b></span></td><td style=\"width:23%;font-size:85%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Uppsala\" title=\"Uppsala\">Uppsala</a></td></tr><tr style=\"vertical-align:top;font-size:85%\"><td style=\"text-align:right\">15:00 <a href=\"/wiki/Central_European_Time\" title=\"Central European Time\">CET</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r1126788409\">.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul{line-height:inherit;list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .plainlist ol li,.mw-parser-output .plainlist ul li{margin-bottom:0}</style><div class=\"plainlist\">\n<ul><li>Selberg <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Booked\"><img alt=\"Yellow card\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/Yellow_card.svg/20px-Yellow_card.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"200\" data-file-height=\"260\" /></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">&#160;18'</span></li></ul></div></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.svenskfotboll.se/matchfakta/ik-uppsala-fotboll-if-brommapojkarna-kval/5383672/\">Report</a></td>\n<td><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409\" /><div class=\"plainlist\">\n<ul><li>Selberg <span class=\"fb-goal\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Own goal\"><img alt=\"red-colored football\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Soccerball-red_with_shade.svg/20px-Soccerball-red_with_shade.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/Soccerball-red_with_shade.svg/40px-Soccerball-red_with_shade.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"333\" data-file-height=\"333\" /></span></span>&#32;<span>19'&#160;(<a href=\"/wiki/Own_goal#Association_football\" title=\"Own goal\">o.g.</a>)</span></span></li></ul></div></td>\n<td>Stadium: <span class=\"location\"><a href=\"/wiki/Studenternas_IP\" title=\"Studenternas IP\">Studenternas IP</a></span><br />Attendance: 653<br />Referee: Eva Svärdsudd</t