collapsible-transparent\" style=\"border-top:1px solid #999;border-bottom:1px solid #999;margin-bottom:-1px;width:100%;background:transparent;color:#202122\"><tbody><tr style=\"vertical-align:top\"><td style=\"width:19%\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap;float:right;margin-left:0.5em\">27 November 2022</span> </td><td class=\"vcard attendee\" style=\"width:23%;text-align:right\"><span class=\"fn org\"><b> <a href=\"/wiki/IF_Brommapojkarna_(women)\" title=\"IF Brommapojkarna (women)\">Brommapojkarna</a> </b></span></td><td style=\"width:12%;text-align:center\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>3–1</b></span></td><td class=\"vcard attendee\" style=\"width:23%\"><span class=\"fn org\"><b> <a href=\"/wiki/IK_Uppsala_Fotboll\" title=\"IK Uppsala Fotboll\">Uppsala</a> </b></span></td><td style=\"width:23%;font-size:85%\"><a href=\"/wiki/V%C3%A4llingby\" title=\"Vällingby\">Vällingby</a></td></tr><tr style=\"vertical-align:top;font-size:85%\"><td style=\"text-align:right\">15:00 <a href=\"/wiki/Central_European_Time\" title=\"Central European Time\">CET</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:right\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409\" /><div class=\"plainlist\">\n<ul><li>Ahlberg <span class=\"fb-goal\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Goal\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/20px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/40px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"333\" data-file-height=\"333\" /></span></span>&#32;<span>5'</span></span></li>\n<li>Johansson Prakt <span class=\"fb-goal\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Goal\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/20px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/40px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"333\" data-file-height=\"333\" /></span></span>&#32;<span>9'</span></span></li>\n<li>Andrup <span class=\"fb-goal\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Goal\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/20px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/40px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"333\" data-file-height=\"333\" /></span></span>&#32;<span>63'</span></span></li></ul></div></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.svenskfotboll.se/matchfakta/if-brommapojkarna-ik-uppsala-fotboll-kval/5383673/\">Report</a></td>\n<td><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1126788409\" /><div class=\"plainlist\">\n<ul><li>Robertson <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Booked\"><img alt=\"Yellow card\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/Yellow_card.svg/20px-Yellow_card.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"200\" data-file-height=\"260\" /></span></span><span style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">&#160;6'</span></li>\n<li>Thorisson <span class=\"fb-goal\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Goal\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/20px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/51/Soccerball_shade.svg/40px-Soccerball_shade.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"333\" data-file-height=\"333\" /></span></span>&#32;<span>62'</span></span></li></ul></div></td>\n<td>Stadium: <span class=\"location\"><a href=\"/wiki/Grimsta_IP\" title=\"Grimsta IP\">Grimsta IP</a></span><br />Attendance: 404<br />Referee: Sara Persson</td></tr></tbody></table></div><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1239335550\" />\n<p><i>Brommapojkarna won 4–1 on aggregate and will remain in Damallsvenskan for the <a href=\"/wiki/2023_Damallsvenskan\" title=\"2023 Damallsvenskan\">2023</a> season.</i>\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Positions_by_Round\">Positions by Round</h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=2022_Damallsvenskan&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Positions by Round\"><span>edit</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<p>The table lists the positions of teams after each week of matches. In order to preserve chronological progress, any matches moved from their original game round are not included in the round at which they were originally scheduled, but added to the full round they were played immediately afterwards. For example, if a match is scheduled for round 13, but then postponed and played between rounds 16 and 17, it will be added to the standings for round 16.\n</p>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyl